@startuml
' Status: Phase 1, read-only Phase 3A, synthetic Phase 3B.1, parser-only
' Phase 3B.2, read-only BIFF evidence verification, and candidate-only Phase
' 3B.3 implemented; admission and cutover proposed
' Implemented sources:
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/model_portfolio_phase3b.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/workbook_source/biff_xls.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/workbook_source/biff_evidence.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/workbook_source/normalization.py
' Synthetic regressions:
' - tests/test_model_portfolio_consolidation_phase3b.py
' - tests/test_biff_xls_source.py
' - tests/test_biff_xls_evidence.py
' - tests/test_biff_xls_normalization.py
' Verified current behavior against:
' - src/portfolio_advisor/main.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/DB_creation/database_create.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/operations/xls_import_watch.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/DB_creation/excel_processing.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/model_portfolio_dry_run.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/model_portfolio_parallel.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/shortlist_parallel.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/shortlist_zero_null.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/shortlist_classification_pair_mapping.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/model_portfolio_phase1.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/model_portfolio_shadow.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/history/repository.py
' - scripts/admit_model_portfolio_phase1.py
' - tests/test_schema_v3_model_portfolio_migration.py
' - tests/test_model_portfolio_consolidation_phase1.py
' - tests/test_model_portfolio_consolidation_phase3a.py
' - tests/test_xls_import_watch.py
' Proposed contract: docs/architecture/model-portfolio-consolidation-plan.md
' Normalization/admission boundary:
' - docs/architecture/biff-xls-normalization-admission-policy-v1.md
' Governing proposal: docs/decisions/ADR-007-consolidate-model-portfolio-workflows.md
title Model-portfolio consolidation: parser + evidence verifier + normalization candidate + synthetic writer [Implemented], admission/cutover [Proposed]

hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 120

actor Operator
actor "Phase 1 developer" as Developer
participant "WatchPaths wrapper\n(or manual CLI)" as Trigger
collections "Retained workbook\nand MNB PDF evidence" as Evidence
participant "Single model admission\ncommand" as Writer
participant "Generated-artifact\npublisher" as Publisher
participant "Temporary-only Phase 1\ncontract command/API" as Phase1
participant "Phase 3A shadow runner\n(explicit opt-in)" as Shadow
participant "BIFF-XLS source parser\n(no admission)" as Parser
participant "Hash-bound BIFF evidence\nverifier (read-only)" as EvidenceVerifier
participant "Normalization + eligibility\nadapter" as Normalizer
database "Isolated schema-v3\ntemporary database" as Temporary
database "portfolio_advisor.sqlite\nproposed operational authority" as Analytical
participant "Model + provenance +\ncorrection validators" as Validators
database "SQLite-API\nrecovery backup" as Backup
database "model_portfolio.sqlite\nfrozen legacy after cutover" as Legacy

== Phase 1 contracts and adapters [Implemented, non-operational] ==

Developer -> Phase1: provide existing temporary v3 database\nand exact admission requests
Phase1 -> Temporary: validate core schema and install additive contract
Phase1 -> Temporary: bind existing source occurrences by\nhash, sheet, row, date, portfolio, and ISIN
Phase1 -> Temporary: append Sustainability attribute and\nseven provider-reported metric observations
Phase1 -> Temporary: append non-operational epoch,\nadmission items, and ordered receipt
Phase1 -> Validators: open connection-bound admission session
Validators -> Temporary: validate provenance, historical manifest,\nexternal evidence, and installed correction contracts once
Phase1 -> Temporary: BEGIN IMMEDIATE\n(session owns outer transaction)
loop 33 workbook admissions and 3 MNB records
    Phase1 -> Temporary: SAVEPOINT; validate exact request; append; RELEASE
    Phase1 -> Temporary: retain exact MNB decimal strings
    Phase1 -> Temporary: validate parsed numerical meaning separately
end
Validators -> Temporary: exhaustively validate completed Phase 1 contract once
alt exit validation succeeds and session state is current
    Phase1 -> Temporary: COMMIT once
else body exception, interruption, stale state, or validation failure
    Phase1 -> Temporary: ROLLBACK entire session
    Phase1 --> Developer: no admission becomes visible or durable
end

Developer -> Phase1: open public validated read session
Phase1 -> Validators: validate pinned connection/database state\nand external dependencies once
loop all 33 observation dates
    Phase1 -> Temporary: read holdings and typed occurrences
    Temporary --> Phase1: MODEL-only projection
    Phase1 -> Phase1: reject if database, sidecar,\nor dependency state changed
end

alt exact request and bindings already admitted
    Temporary --> Phase1: exact replay confirmed
    Phase1 --> Developer: NO-OP
else changed source, hash, date, or binding
    Temporary --> Phase1: mismatch
    Phase1 -> Temporary: no mutation\n(ROLLBACK if transaction opened)
    Phase1 --> Developer: reject without partial admission
end

alt numerically equal MNB value with changed source text
    Temporary --> Phase1: exact-evidence fingerprint mismatch
    Phase1 --> Developer: reject; preserve admitted bytes
end

Developer -> Temporary: optionally exercise dedicated synthetic MNB contract
note over Phase1, Temporary
  Phase 1 does not parse or insert workbooks, migrate retained data,
  select an application default, alter the watcher, or authorize cutover.
  MNB observations remain weekly OTC evidence and are never NAV.
end note

== Phase 3A consumer injection and shadow comparison [Implemented, non-operational] ==

Developer -> Shadow: provide legacy reader, explicit analytical reader,\nand eight named workflow captures
Shadow -> Legacy: fingerprint isolated legacy source
Shadow -> Temporary: fingerprint isolated analytical source
Shadow -> Legacy: capture advisor/current + temporal ranking,\nstrict coverage, features, prospective input,\nLTIA model side, and exact MNB semantics
Shadow -> Phase1: open one validated analytical read session
Phase1 -> Validators: validate pinned database, authority epoch,\nhistorical manifest, corrections, and dependencies once
loop every non-blocked workflow
    Shadow -> Phase1: capture through the shared validated reader
    Shadow -> Shadow: compare values, missingness, warnings,\nordering, ties, provenance, and exact MNB text
    alt exact reviewed path/value difference
        Shadow -> Shadow: retain difference plus concrete reason
    else unexplained or stale allowlist difference
        Shadow --> Developer: FAIL CLOSED; no successful report
    end
end
alt database, sidecar, or dependency changed before exit
    Phase1 --> Shadow: exit validation fails
    Shadow --> Developer: no successful report
else session exit validation succeeds
    Phase1 --> Shadow: validated session closed
    Shadow --> Developer: finalize PASS or PARTIAL report
end

note over Shadow, Validators
  Model snapshots and optional direct portfolio NAV are separate inputs.
  After the maintained evidence refresh, all eight retained-corpus workflows
  pass: 1,224 coverage identities, 408 feature rows, and 1,224 labels.
  Every label remains explicitly unavailable; no NAV, eligibility, or
  successful financial label is synthesized.
  Existing application, importer, watcher, and CLI defaults remain legacy.
end note

== Phase 3B.2 BIFF source envelope [Implemented, no admission] ==

Operator -> Parser: supply one ordinary .xls source path
Parser -> Parser: read bytes once; SHA-256 same bytes passed to xlrd
Parser -> Parser: require terminal valid date and exact visible\nleading-space model + shortlist sheet names
Parser -> Parser: preserve ordered headers, coordinates, cell types,\nraw values, formats, merges, and duplicate occurrences
Parser -> Parser: warn on anomalous currency-risk, sustainability,\nand text-zero metric values without changing them
Parser --> Operator: canonical versioned envelope + fingerprints\nstatus NOT_EVALUATED_PARSER_ONLY

note over Operator, Parser
  Real ANALYTICAL_SHORTLIST is not the synthetic terméklista role.
  Numeric zero, blank, empty, text zero, and error remain distinct.
  xlrd exposes cached formula results only when present; formula text and
  reliable formula presence are unavailable, and nothing is evaluated.
  No SQLite write, file movement, watcher route, correction, or admission.
end note

== Recovery/formula verifier [Implemented]; bounded evidence approvals [Recorded, enforcement not implemented] ==

Operator -> EvidenceVerifier: provide processed directory, committed 33-hash\ninventory, and fresh external report path
EvidenceVerifier -> EvidenceVerifier: independently inspect CFBF/FAT allocation,\nWorkbook chain, BIFF BOF/EOF, cells, XF, blanks, and formula records
EvidenceVerifier -> EvidenceVerifier: cross-check values with Calamine and\nprovenance/types with the published parser
alt hash, layout, record, value, type, format, or formula discrepancy
    EvidenceVerifier --> Operator: FAIL CLOSED; nonzero exit; no successful report
else all exact hash-bound checks pass
    EvidenceVerifier --> Operator: deterministic evidence report\naudit-time recovery/formula/admission approval fields NOT_GRANTED
end

note over Parser, EvidenceVerifier
  Six hashes open strictly. The 27 exact recovery hashes have a user-approved
  exception dated 2026-09-26, subject to every hash/signature/comparison condition;
  no eligibility mechanism enforces it. The finding of zero covered formula records
  is approved as sufficient only for the current bytes of all 33 exact hashes, not
  for upstream authoring history. Neither approval authorizes admission.
end note

== Phase 3B.3 normalization candidate [Implemented, no admission] ==

Operator -> Normalizer: provide exact v1 envelope, expected workbook hash,\nand optional exact approved mapping bytes
Normalizer -> Normalizer: bind every cell coordinate/type/value/format;\nderive original typed values without scaling
Normalizer -> Normalizer: keep model and shortlist zero rules separate;\npreserve duplicate occurrences and exact sheet names
Normalizer -> Normalizer: reject invalid field normalization without coercion;\nemit occurrence-specific unresolved policy diagnostics
Normalizer --> Operator: deterministic BIFF_XLS_NORMALIZATION_CANDIDATE_V1\nstatus NOT_EVALUATED_NORMALIZATION_CANDIDATE_ONLY\nadmission_approval NOT_GRANTED

note over Parser, Normalizer
  Recovery/formula evidence sub-decisions are approved only for the exact
  27/33 hash registries; eligibility enforcement is not implemented and
  admission remains NOT_GRANTED. Proposed currency-risk translations are not
  authorized. Shortlist numeric
  zero remains an original 0.0 and becomes effective NULL only through the
  exact existing ADR-003 correction binding. Model zero-to-absence is a
  separate legacy-compatible proposal requiring approval for real sources.
  Exact approved English mapping bytes may produce reference-only candidates;
  their existing dataset admission is not inherited. No implemented writer
  consumes this format. Phase
  3B.1's approved synthetic atomic behavior is not reopened; only a future
  real-workbook admission policy remains undecided.
end note

== Phase 3B.1 synthetic temporary writer [Implemented, non-operational] ==

box "Generated synthetic input boundary" #E8F4FF
Operator -> Writer: supply exact two-sheet JSON envelope,\nauthorization, expected predecessor + before fingerprints
Writer -> Evidence: verify input SHA-256; retain content-addressed bytes
Evidence --> Writer: portable relative path + verified hash
Writer -> Writer: validate sheet roles, names, ordered headers,\nrows, parser/NULL rules, identifiers, and raw payloads
end box

alt exact receipt and every binding already exist
    Writer -> Analytical: validate schema, source/metric bindings,\nreceipt chain, outbox, corrections, integrity + foreign keys
    Analytical --> Writer: exact replay; no mutation
else changed date/content/authority/predecessor/before-state
    Writer --> Operator: REJECT
else new append with installed Phase 1/manifest/correction bindings
    Writer --> Operator: REJECT before durable database mutation
else new supported synthetic envelope
    Writer -> Analytical: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    activate Analytical
    Writer -> Analytical: append both source sheets, snapshots,\noccurrences, metrics, lineage, sheet dispositions + receipt
    Writer -> Analytical: insert FILE_FINALIZATION + ARTIFACT_REFRESH PENDING
    Writer -> Validators: exhaustive candidate validation
    alt either sheet, interruption, stale binding, or validation fails
        Validators --> Writer: FAIL CLOSED
        Writer -> Analytical: ROLLBACK both sheets, receipt + outbox
    else every gate passes
        Validators --> Writer: validated
        Writer -> Analytical: COMMIT once
        Writer --> Operator: admission complete; pending work recorded
    end
    deactivate Analytical
end

note over Writer, Validators
  Input, database, and retention paths must resolve below the system temp root;
  symlinks and hard links fail closed. Concurrent exact submissions serialize
  and converge on one receipt. Outbox execution is not implemented.
end note

== Phase 3B operational writer [Proposed, not authorized] ==

box "Operator-controlled input boundary" #E8F4FF
Operator -> Trigger: supply stable workbook
Trigger -> Writer: request admission under common manual/watcher lock
end box

alt another manual or watcher writer owns the lock
    Writer --> Trigger: leave input pending; retry later
else writer lock acquired
    Writer -> Evidence: retain bytes at non-overwriting content-addressed path
    Evidence --> Writer: verify retained SHA-256
    Writer -> Writer: inventory every visible sheet and role
    Writer -> Writer: parse retained bytes; validate headers, categories,\ndate, identifiers, stable rows, and prior receipt
end

alt exact workbook and all bindings already admitted
    Writer -> Analytical: read matching immutable receipt
    Analytical --> Writer: exact replay confirmed
    Writer --> Trigger: NO-OP; resume pending post-commit work
else same date with changed bytes or bindings
    Writer --> Trigger: REJECT before mutation
else changed dual-sheet workbook before policy approval
    Writer --> Trigger: REJECT; retain explicit sheet inventory\nand pending evidence
else new workbook permitted by an approved sheet policy
    Writer -> Backup: create and verify consistent recovery snapshot
    Backup --> Writer: recovery manifest and checksum
    Writer -> Analytical: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    activate Analytical
    Writer -> Analytical: recheck predecessor receipt, evidence hash,\nand expected before-fingerprint
    Writer -> Analytical: append source, sheets, dispositions, snapshots,\noccurrences, typed fields, metrics, lineage, receipt, and outbox
    Writer -> Validators: validate candidate transaction state
    activate Validators
    Validators -> Analytical: integrity + foreign keys + installed schema
    Validators -> Analytical: stable lineage and all-date model projection
    Validators -> Analytical: all installed shortlist correction contracts

    alt model projection or provenance mismatch
        Validators --> Writer: FAIL CLOSED
        Writer -> Analytical: ROLLBACK
        Writer --> Trigger: rejection; workbook remains pending
    else shortlist evidence would change bound dataset\nwithout a separately authorized correction disposition
        Validators --> Writer: FAIL CLOSED pending separate authorization
        Writer -> Analytical: ROLLBACK
        Writer --> Trigger: no automatic correction inheritance
    else every gate passes
        Validators --> Writer: validated
        Writer -> Analytical: COMMIT
        Writer --> Trigger: database admission complete; post-commit work pending
    end
    deactivate Validators
    deactivate Analytical
end

group Post-commit filesystem and artifact work [Proposed]
    Writer -> Evidence: finalize processed marker / incoming-file disposition
    alt filesystem finalization fails
        Writer -> Analytical: keep durable FILE_FINALIZATION_PENDING work
        Writer --> Trigger: committed admission; retry exact receipt
    else filesystem finalization succeeds
        Writer -> Publisher: claim refresh work for committed receipt
        Publisher -> Publisher: build coverage -> missing-data policy ->\nstrict validation -> features -> labels as candidates
        Publisher -> Validators: validate complete dependency generation
        alt candidate build or validation fails
            Publisher -> Analytical: keep REFRESH_PENDING and failure detail
            Publisher --> Trigger: prior published generation remains active
        else complete generation validates
            Publisher -> Publisher: atomically promote one generation manifest
            Publisher -> Analytical: mark receipt generation complete
            Publisher --> Trigger: admission and refresh complete
        end
    end
end

note over Writer, Publisher
  SQLite commit, workbook finalization, and artifact publication are separate
  failure domains. A committed receipt is never erased because later work fails.
  Exact replay resumes durable work without duplicating source observations.
end note

== Separately authorized cutover ==

Operator -> Trigger: quiesce watcher and verify no pending input
Operator -> Backup: create full cutover recovery package
Operator -> Analytical: apply approved authority epoch and shared default
Operator -> Legacy: freeze; do not delete or resume writes
note over Analytical, Legacy
  Current state remains legacy-authoritative until this
  separately approved transition completes all release gates.
end note

== Post-cutover recovery ==

alt software rollback after newer imports
    Operator -> Analytical: retain consolidated authority and receipts
    Analytical --> Operator: generate temporary validated flat compatibility export
    note over Operator, Legacy
      Never point old code at a stale frozen legacy file.
    end note
else damaged analytical store
    Operator -> Backup: restore latest verified analytical snapshot elsewhere
    Operator -> Evidence: replay later immutable admissions in order
    Evidence --> Operator: current state reconstructed and revalidated
end

@enduml
